 Mire review | unified | focus: review | context: 3 | wrap: off
 Files                 Navigation and layout
> file.txt             q / Esc      quit
  image.bin            ?            toggle help
                       Tab          switch sidebar/review focus
                       j / Down     scroll or select next file
                       k / Up       scroll or select previous file
                       PgDn         page down
                       PgUp         page up
                       g / Home     first row
                       G / End      last row
                       ]            next file
                       [            previous file
                       }            next hunk
                       {            previous hunk
                       /            search
                       n            next search match
                       N            previous search match
                       +            show more context
                       -            show less context
                       w            toggle line wrapping
                       1            unified layout
                       2            split layout
 Tab focus | j/k move | [ ] files | { } hunks | / search | +/- context | w wrap | ? help |
